%% Loading and organizing thalamic spindle data
% This script loads sleep spindle data separately for each of 56 thalamic
% channels. The data corresponding to each channel are stored in a cell
% array, allowing the spindle data to be accessed independently by channel.
% The complete cell array containing the spindle data from all channels is
% then saved as a MAT file for subsequent analysis.

clc 
clear 
close all 
%%

% pathsthal = dir('*/thal_spindles_ch*');


for k=1:56
% 
